1em] text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"> Nightly rates </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> How Much Does an Airbnb Cost per Night in Garden City Beach? </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div id="monthly-rates"> <p>The average nightly rate in Garden City Beach, known as ADR (average daily rate), was <strong>$371</strong> over the past year, about the same as the South Carolina average ($355) and about 16% above the U.S. average of $320. In a typical year, rates swing with the seasons, from about $285 in November to about $460 in June and July.</p><p>Prices span a wide range: the top 10% charge about 3.4 times the rate of the bottom quarter.</p><ul class="not-prose my-5 space-y-1.5"><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#5f5ab8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Best-in-class properties</span> (top 10%) charge <strong>$705+</strong> a night, about 2.5 times the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#8884d8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Strong performers</span> (top 25%) charge <strong>$420</strong> or more, about $140 above the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#b3b0e6"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Typical properties</span> (median) charge about <strong>$280</strong> a night.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#dddcf5"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Entry-level properties</span> (bottom 25%) charge <strong>$205</strong> or less, about three-quarters of the median.</li></ul><div class="not-prose my-8"><figure class="pseo-figure font-lato rounded-[4px] bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06),0_3px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.07)] p-5 sm:p-6 [&#38;_.pseo-table]:shadow-none"> <figcaption> <p class="text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]">July rates run 63% above November&#39;s</p> <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">Average nightly rate (ADR), by month, September 2024 to August 2026</p>  </figcaption> <div class="mt-5"><div class="pseo-line relative select-none font-lato" style="height:260px" role="img" aria-label="Average nightly rate in Garden City Beach by month, September 2024 to August 2026" data-pseo-chart> <div class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-0 top-[10px] w-[46px]" aria-hidden="true"> <span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:100%"> $0 </span><span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:66.66666666666667%"> $200 </span><span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:33.33333333333334%"> $400 </span><span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:0%"> $600 </span>  </div> <div class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-[46px] top-[10px]" style="right:16px" data-plot> <span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:100%;border-color:#cbd5e1" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:66.66666666666667%;border-color:#e9eef4" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:33.33333333333334%;border-color:#e9eef4" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:0%;border-color:#e9eef4" aria-hidden="true"></span>  <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full overflow-visible" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M0,514.8809055118112L43.47826086956522,557.3