+  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Café</strong></h2><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Fuel&nbsp;your &nbsp;adventure&nbsp;at&nbsp;our beachfront café! Start&nbsp;your morning&nbsp;right with a hot&nbsp;breakfast served fresh&nbsp;from&nbsp;7 AM to&nbsp;10:30 AM. Craving something hearty later&nbsp;in&nbsp;the day? Our classic&nbsp;menu of&nbsp;juicy burgers, all-beef&nbsp;hot dogs, and crispy fries is available&nbsp;all day long. Whether you're grabbing a quick bite between&nbsp;catches&nbsp;or settling&nbsp;in for&nbsp;a night of family fun and entertainment, we’ve got something for everyone. Check out our signature Hugo burger, named after the monster hurricane that destroyed the pier in 1989.</p><p class="" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"></p></div>
