+			<p><a href="/images/ilm/climate/Ian/IanVIS_anim.gif"><img alt="Visible satellite and radar animation of Hurricane Ian making landfall on the South Carolina coastline on September 30, 2022" src="/images/ilm/climate/Ian/IanVIS_anim.gif" style="width: 725px;" /></a></p>
+
+			<p>Visible satellite and radar animation of Hurricane Ian making landfall on the South Carolina coastline on September 30, 2022</p>
+			</td>
