+
+			<p>Infrared satellite loop of Hurricane Ian&#39;s final landfall on the South Carolina coast on September 30, 2022</p>
+			</td>
+			<td>
+			<p><a href="/images/ilm/climate/Ian/IanTrack.png"><img alt="Observed path of Hurricane Ian between September 23 and September 30, 2022" src="/images/ilm/climate/Ian/IanTrack.png" style="width: 270px; height: 337px;" /></a></p>
+
+			<p>Track of Hurricane Ian between September 23 and September 30, 2022.&nbsp; Ian struck Cuba and Florida as a major hurricane before reaching the Carolinas as a category 1 storm.</p>
+			</td>
